# GOVERNMENT OF BANGKALAN REGENCY

REGIONAL REGULATION OF BANGKALAN REGENCY

# NUMBER 6 OF 2009

# CONCERNING

# THE IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN

# AND CHILD VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

# BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

# THE REGENT OF BANGKALAN,
a. that until now the number of violence against women and children in Bangkalan Regency is still high, while services and protection have not been carried out optimally;  
b. that in connection with the consideration referred to in letter a, it is deemed necessary to regulate the implementation of protection for women and child victims of violence by Regional Regulation.  
1. Law Number 12 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions Within the Province of East Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1950 Number 41), as amended by Law Number 2 of 1965 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1965 Number 19, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2730);  
